  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Equation of plane passing through the intersection of two given Plane&nbsp;<math><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> is,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8757;</mo></math>&nbsp;It passes through <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>1,</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> Equation of plane <math><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>",
